    "durationMs": 158985,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and fully verified. Final state:\n\n**Project layout**\n- `app/` — FastAPI app: `links.py` (routes), `schemas.py` (pydantic validation), `models.py` (SQLAlchemy `Link` model), `database.py` (engine/session from `DATABASE_URL`), `config.py`, `main.py`\n- `migrations/` — Alembic env + initial migration creating the `links` table (unique `code`, `url`, `clicks`, `created_at`)\n- `start.sh` — runs `alembic upgrade head`, then serves uvicorn in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`\n- `requirements.txt` (pinned to preinstalled versions), `README.md` with a start section, `tests/test_api.py`\n\n**Verified against the live Postgres (29/29 tests passing)**\n- POST `/links` → 201 with generated or custom code; submitted URL returned byte-for-byte unchanged (uppercase hosts, query/fragment, 2000-char and unicode URLs — I wrote a custom `urlsplit`-based validator because pydantic's `HttpUrl` wrongly rejects URLs over 2084 chars)\n- Duplicate custom code → 409 `{\"error\": ...}`; malformed JSON, bad/missing `url`, bad `code` (in body and path) → 422 `{\"error\": ...}`; unknown codes → 404\n- GET `/r/{code}` → 302 with correct `Location`, clicks increment exactly once — 30 parallel redirects yielded exactly 30 clicks (atomic SQL `clicks + 1`)\n- GET `/links` → creation-ordered items with `total`\n- Kill + `sh start.sh` restart: data and click counts persisted; migrations are idempotent\n\nTest data was truncated and the dev server stopped, so the database is clean for the automated suite."
